"id": "req_note",
"x": 980,
"y": 226,
"width": 580,
"height": 72,
"text": "A request handler cannot hold a four minute model call open,\nand neither can waitUntil. The handler only enqueues. The\nconsumer has room to run all three stages, and it brings\nretries with it.",
