"id": "vf_note",
"x": 84,
"y": 3810,
"width": 1500,
"height": 60,
"text": "The failure this exists to catch: the client looks up an element by id, the server renders it from a\ndifferent file. Rename one side and nothing errors, nothing 404s, the page looks perfect, and a button\nsilently does nothing. The gate reads every selector the client depends on and checks it against the page that needs it.",
"originalText": "The failure this exists to catch: the client looks up an element by id, the server renders it from a\ndifferent file. Rename one side and nothing errors, nothing 404s, the page looks perfect, and a button\nsilently does nothing. The gate reads every selector the client depends on and checks it against the page that needs it.",
"fontSize": 13,
"fontFamily": 2,
